+/*
+ * k618: the phone's own 5.15 driver (hwkm.c, qti_hwkm_set_tpkey) prepares the key-manager slave
+ * of the inline crypto engine once, before its first wrapped key: receive mode on, the trust
+ * management engine asked through tmecom-intf to hand its key to the slave, receive mode off. This
+ * release's driver has no such step, and without it the firmware refuses every wrapped key with
